# @nour/utils intentionally COMMITS its build output.
#
# package.json points main/types/exports at ./dist/*, and the package is
# consumed as a PREBUILT workspace dependency (apps/nickstire's vite build,
# apps/statenour, apps/worker). On a fresh clone — e.g. a Railway build —
# dist/ must already exist or `vite build` fails with:
#   [commonjs--resolver] Failed to resolve entry for package "@nour/utils"
#
# The root .gitignore has a blanket `dist/` rule; these negations override
# it for THIS package only. After changing src/, rebuild + commit dist:
#   pnpm --filter @nour/utils build
!dist/
!dist/**
